# TOTP development build

This archive is an unreleased Actions build, not a production GitHub Release.
All binaries target x86 (32-bit). Extract with paths intact into the server root.
The plugin is a SA-MP/open.mp legacy plugin, not a native open.mp component.
Do not load multiple copies. Keep libcrypto beside the server executable.
Include files are provided for both pawno and qawno; use the one for your editor.
This ZIP does not replace your server configuration. Merge the following settings.

## Windows

- Requires Windows 10/Server 2016 or newer and a compatible x86 server.
- plugins/TOTP.dll and libcrypto-3.dll are included.
- SA-MP server.cfg: append TOTP to the existing plugins line.
- open.mp config.json: add "TOTP" to the pawn.legacy_plugins array.
- Install the x86 Microsoft Visual C++ Redistributable for the compiler toolset.
  CRT DLLs are not included in the plugin ZIP. Windows supplies the UCRT/API sets.

Installation: https://learn.microsoft.com/cpp/windows/latest-supported-vc-redist

